# A suite in a 16-core Slurm allocation must not divide the whole node's
# CPU count among its tests. An explicit compile_threads still wins.
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/compile_affinity.py | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: affinity: 1 thread per test
# CHECK-NEXT: fallback: 4 threads per test
# CHECK-NEXT: override: 8 threads per test
